#: app/src/EqualizerPanel.cpp:106
msgid ""
"Selects the Flat preset: every band and the preamp back to 0 dB, which makes the equaliser bit-transparent again."
msgstr ""

#: app/src/EqualizerPanel.cpp:112
msgid ""
"31 bands, ±20 dB. Changes apply to the track already playing. A boost can clip; the preamp is the headroom for it."
msgstr ""

#: app/src/EqualizerPanel.cpp:142
msgid "Enable"
msgstr ""

#: app/src/EqualizerPanel.cpp:144
msgid ""
"Bypasses the equaliser without disturbing the curve, which is what comparing one against the original needs. A flat equaliser is skipped either way, so this costs nothing until a band is moved."
msgstr ""

#: app/src/EqualizerPanel.cpp:158
msgid ""
"Presets store ten points; the 31 bands are interpolated from them. Moving any slider afterwards leaves the curve alone and changes this to Custom."
msgstr ""

#: app/src/EqualizerPanel.cpp:165
msgid "Follow the track's genre"
msgstr ""

#: app/src/EqualizerPanel.cpp:167
msgid ""
"Chooses the preset whose name matches each track's genre tag as it starts. A track with no genre, or one nothing matches, gets Flat -- so this rewrites the equaliser at every track boundary rather than only when it has something to say."
msgstr ""

